      "topic": "subject_pronouns",
      "ruleId": "a1-subject-pronouns",
      "type": "fill_blank",
      "question": "Complete: Next to me is Marco. ___ is from Italy.",
      "answer": "He",
      "answers": [
        "He",
        "he"
      ],
      "explanation": "Marco → he. \"He am\" would be wrong; here the verb is is."
