      "ruleId": "a1-subject-pronouns",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "question": "From the reading: Laura, Marco and the group study together. Which sentence is correct?",
      "options": [
        "We are a small group.",
        "We is a small group.",
        "Us are a small group.",
        "He are a small group."
      ],
      "answer": "We are a small group.",
      "explanation": "We (Laura + classmates) takes are — applied from the reading, not memorization of a random blank."
